# Model of the object called teabox, for the Render-Based Tracker (vpRBTracker).
# Generated from config/mbt/teabox/teabox.cao: rectangular parallelepiped of 0.165 x 0.068 m, and 0.08 m high.
# The vertices are written Y-up, as expected by the OBJ loader of Panda3D, which converts them to Z-up:
# the object frame is then the one of teabox.cao (X in [0, 0.165], Y in [0, 0.068], Z in [-0.08, 0]),
# in which the points of teabox.init are expressed.
mtllib teabox.mtl
o teabox
v 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
v 0.000000 -0.080000 0.000000
v 0.165000 -0.080000 0.000000
v 0.165000 0.000000 0.000000
v 0.165000 0.000000 -0.068000
v 0.165000 -0.080000 -0.068000
v 0.000000 -0.080000 -0.068000
v 0.000000 0.000000 -0.068000
vn 0.0000 0.0000 1.0000
vn 0.0000 -1.0000 0.0000
vn 0.0000 0.0000 -1.0000
vn 0.0000 1.0000 0.0000
vn 1.0000 0.0000 0.0000
vn -1.0000 0.0000 0.0000
usemtl teabox
s off
f 1//1 2//1 3//1 4//1
f 2//2 7//2 6//2 3//2
f 5//3 6//3 7//3 8//3
f 1//4 4//4 5//4 8//4
f 6//5 5//5 4//5 3//5
f 1//6 8//6 7//6 2//6
